\label{lem:general bisim facts}
	Let \(F\) be a functor, and \((X, h)\) and \((Y, k)\) be \(F\)-coalgebras.
	\begin{enumerate}
		\item If \(R_i \subseteq X \times Y\) is a bisimulation for each \(i \in I\), then \(\bigcup_{i \in I} R_i\) is a bisimulation.
